OL,3,AArrests made in Mohamed Al Fayed probe
OL,4,Ain France, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrench police have made arrests after
OL,7,Fthree properties, including the Ritz
OL,8,Fhotel in Paris, were searched in
OL,9,Frelation to an investigation into
OL,10,FMohamed Al Fayed's abuse.
OL,12,FThe Paris prosecutor's office told the
OL,13,FBBC that several individuals were taken
OL,14,Finto custody for questioning last month
OL,15,Fand later released.
OL,17,FIn a confidential letter sent to
OL,18,Fsurvivors, the Metropolitan Police said
OL,19,Fits officers were present during the
OL,20,Fsearches on 13 and 14 October, in what
OL,21,Fis understood to be a joint operation
OL,22,Fbetween British and French authorities.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
