OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUS House to vote on moving forward with
OL,4,AHegseth impeachment
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn addition to Massie, Democratic
OL,7,Flawmakers such as minority leader
OL,8,FHakeem Jeffries say they back
OL,9,Fimpeaching Hegseth, but President
OL,10,FDonald Trump says his defence secretary
OL,11,Fgets an "'A' PLUS"
OL,13,FVice-President JD Vance has blamed the
OL,14,Fwar for Republicans' sweeping midterms
OL,15,Flosses, but says it is "absurd" to
OL,16,Fsuggest Hegseth has committed
OL,17,Fimpeachable crimes
OL,19,FImpeachment and removal from office is
OL,20,Flikely to be an uphill climb, as
OL,21,FRepublicans remain in power in Congress
OL,22,Funtil January
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
